          "quote": "肺结节资料可以等明天眼科处理后再找"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00159",
          "explanation": "Doctor finalizes the reprioritized plan: continue current eye care, defer lung CT to later, and ensure the caregiver understands the order.",
          "quote": "黄斑门诊及肺结节旧CT资料按您说的顺序处理即可"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 requires dynamic reprioritization after symptom screening and information gathering. The doctor initially lists both eye and lung threads, obtains red-flag answers (no extreme pain, no sudden vision loss), discovers the stable lung nodule, and then explicitly reprioritizes eye medication and follow-up as urgent while placing the lung CT into a lower-urgency deferred task—this is a clear, explained, and executed reprioritization.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
