          "event_id": "lite_evt_00112",
          "explanation": "Doctor corrects the family's misconception that all three bottles can be grouped the same way by adding concrete spacing and instruction about hormonal drops, improving their mental model for future decisions.",
          "quote": "左氧氟沙星和普拉洛芬也以今天正式医嘱为准；您说“好像用到一周”的疗程仍需核实。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO1 was partially triggered by the family referring to '眼内打药' and '消炎药,' but the misconception correction was not fully separated from the standard medication-safety and document-quality instructions already covered by RC4/RC7, and there is no explicit caregiver restatement of the corrected point.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
