    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00159",
          "explanation": "Final closure message distinguishes resolved versus still-open threads: eye symptoms and current medication plan are safe, while lung CT and yellow-spot clinic follow-ups remain deferred.",
          "quote": "黄斑门诊及肺结节旧CT资料按您说的顺序处理即可"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO3's bounded-closure summary is partially achieved: the doctor states what has been safely addressed and leaves unresolved items (lung CT date, yellow-spot clinic) with an owner, but the residual-risk classification and exact timing for the lung CT are not fully elaborated, and the closure is slightly more open-ended than the perfect bounded-closure template.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
